  "required": [
    "schemaVersion",
    "source",
    "pages",
    "blocks"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "title": "Ground truth (gt.json)",
  "description": "Every data-gt block of one printed PDF fixture. Not expressible in JSON Schema: ids are unique; the orders are a permutation of 0..n-1; page ≤ number of pages; the bbox lies inside its page (x1 ≤ width, y1 ≤ height); continues names a block of the same type on an earlier page; a table cell's row + rowSpan ≤ rows and col + colSpan ≤ cols; a cell checkbox's bbox lies inside its block's page."
}
